        "original_id": "fccfb933-1d4b-5d75-b944-67f2c17c320d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Groening, Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, Rich Moore, Hank Azaria, James L. Brooks\n- Works: \"The Telltale Head\"\n- Characters: Apu Nahasapeemapetilon, Homer Simpson\n- Roles: writer, director, voice actor, creator, designer\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Groening was born on February 15, 1954, and he is an American cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, and voice actor.\n- Homer Simpson was created and designed by Matt Groening while Matt Groening was waiting in the lobby of James L. Brooks' office.\n- \"The Telltale Head\" was written by Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, and Matt Groening.\n- \"The Telltale Head\" was directed by Rich Moore.\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon is voiced by Hank Azaria.\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon first appeared in the episode \"The Telltale Head\".",
